※ pl4g-test: compile=error
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4614 LANG_ARENA_VALUE_OUTLIVES

※ A name bound further out than an arena outlives it, so something made in the arena may
※ not be put there: it would still be named after the arena was given back.  It is the rule
※ a reference follows, asked of what an arena holds.

fn kept(c: bool) → bool:
    let held: mut str = "-"
    if c:
        let pool: mut arena = ⎕arena
        defer ⎕empty(pool)
        held ← "a" ⧺ "b" in pool
    held = "ab"

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    if kept(true): 0u6 else: 1u6
